contour 6 12 line 4.5 12 curve 2 12 2 14.5 curve 2 17 4.5 17 line 6 17
layer light
contour 6 13 line 6 3.5 curve 6 2 7.5 2 curve 9 2 9 3.5 line 9 13
contour 10 13 line 10 8.5 curve 10 7 11.5 7 curve 13 7 13 8.5 line 13 13
contour 14 13 line 14 9.5 curve 14 8 15.5 8 curve 17 8 17 9.5 line 17 13
