# A ring with a hole. In each frame a dark dot is one eighth of a turn
# further, clockwise: one turn in one second.
shape wait hot 11 11
layer dark
circle 11.5 11.5 9
layer light
circle 11.5 11.5 8
layer dark
circle 11.5 11.5 4.5
layer clear
circle 11.5 11.5 3.5
frame 125
layer dark
circle 11.5 5.25 1.25
frame 125
layer dark
circle 15.919 7.081 1.25
frame 125
layer dark
circle 17.75 11.5 1.25
frame 125
layer dark
circle 15.919 15.919 1.25
frame 125
layer dark
circle 11.5 17.75 1.25
frame 125
layer dark
circle 7.081 15.919 1.25
frame 125
layer dark
circle 5.25 11.5 1.25
frame 125
layer dark
circle 7.081 7.081 1.25

